<!-- Why Cooperative AI Section -->
<section class="py-20 bg-yellow-50">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 text-center mb-12">
      Why Cooperative AI
    </h2>
    
    <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Cooperative AI represents a fundamental shift in how we approach artificial intelligence. Instead of focusing solely on individual AI systems, 
        we're exploring how multiple AI agents can work together effectively, safely, and beneficially for humanity.
      </p>
      
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
        This research is crucial because as AI systems become more sophisticated, they will increasingly need to coordinate with each other and with humans. 
        Understanding how to design cooperative AI systems that are fair, transparent, and aligned with human values is essential for a safe AI future.
      </p>
      
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Our fellowship focuses on developing the theoretical foundations and practical applications of cooperative AI, ensuring that these systems 
        enhance human cooperation rather than undermine it, and that they contribute to solving complex global challenges.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Why South Africa Section -->
<section class="py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 text-center mb-12">
      Why South Africa
    </h2>
    
    <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
        South Africa offers a unique environment for cooperative AI research, with its rich cultural diversity, complex social dynamics, and growing tech ecosystem. 
        Cape Town, in particular, provides an ideal setting for international collaboration and innovation.
      </p>
      
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
        The country's history of overcoming challenges through cooperation and dialogue makes it an excellent location for studying how AI systems can 
        support and enhance human cooperation across diverse communities and contexts. This setting allows fellows to develop AI solutions that are 
        culturally sensitive and globally relevant.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
